        <td>-3</td>
        <td>Parameters are malformed.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/ERR_RUNTIME_PERMISSIONS" target="_blank">ERR_RUNTIME_PERMISSIONS</a></td>
        <td>-4</td>
        <td>Script lacks the runtime permission to perform the requested task.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/ERR_THROTTLED" target="_blank">ERR_THROTTLED</a></td>
